  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 15 + 17 ÷ 27 × 3 − 10 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **+**\n **−**\n **×**\n **÷**\n \n \n\n **−**\n **+**\n **÷**\n **×**\n \n \n\nNow, replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 15 − 17 × 27 ÷ 3 + 10 = ?\n\n⇒ 15 − __**17 × 27**__ ÷ 3 + 10 = ?\n\n⇒ 15 − __**459 ÷ 3**__ + 10 = ?\n\n⇒ 15 − __**153**__ + 10 = ?\n\n⇒ __**15 − 153**__ + 10 = ?\n\n⇒ __**-138 + 10**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**-128**__\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\"**.",
